# Icons — Phosphor only for new components

```tsx
// ✅ New components
import { MagnifyingGlass, X, Check, Warning } from "@phosphor-icons/react"
<MagnifyingGlass size={16} />   // always explicit size

// ⚠️ Existing components (don't change, don't add new)
import { Search, X } from "lucide-react"
```

Never rely on `1em` default size — always pass `size` prop explicitly.
